   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "家中酒店式卧室",
   "texts": [
    "卧室的一面墙上挂满镜子，室内放有堆满纺织品的床、扶手椅、落地灯和鲜花。",
    "<p>你是否想过把卧室改造成酒店式度假套房？以下是打造休闲卧室的几点建议，让你可以随心“入住”，远离一切烦恼和压力。</p>",
    "家中酒店式卧室",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4c/66/4c6676cc0cb7efb9df862cd9d5d77000.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4c/66/4c6676cc0cb7efb9df862cd9d5d77000.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "刚铺好的床，上面放有多个枕头和多层纺织品。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60229636"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/31/86/31864d6aa8dd7b3c02ad4fc355f72dc6.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/31/86/31864d6aa8dd7b3c02ad4fc355f72dc6.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>在床上摆放&nbsp;</strong>多个枕头和多层纺织品，你可以随意搭配，打造自己喜欢的组合。选择你感觉格外舒适的纺织品，放在一张跳上去就不想下来的床上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "卧室衣柜，带推拉门和抽屉柜。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f9/03/f903ceccb3ffb398de5e64e1c5baac94.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f9/03/f903ceccb3ffb398de5e64e1c5baac94.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>房间给人留下的第一印象是宁静整洁</strong>&nbsp;，看起来就像家政刚刚打扫完一样。封闭式衣柜和抽屉柜，可让一切杂物远离视线。相近的色彩也有助于营造和谐的气氛。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "卧室内的桌子上放着点燃的蜡烛和鲜花。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/27/bb/27bb52124c1b4272dd6d16b8dbc35cd9.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/27/bb/27bb52124c1b4272dd6d16b8dbc35cd9.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>鲜花和点燃的蜡烛让惬意气氛倍增</strong>&nbsp;，给人带来感官愉悦。为获得更为奢华的度假氛围，大胆打造一面装满镜子的墙壁吧。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "带双层窗帘的窗户。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/68/4c/684c2179a3966e884655342ec03e70ee.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/68/4c/684c2179a3966e884655342ec03e70ee.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>请勿&nbsp;打扰</strong>。多层窗帘让你可以随时屏蔽纷扰的世界。透明轻薄的内层窗帘可以引入自然光，还能保护隐私。上面的厚窗帘可以遮挡光线，减少噪声。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "床的一侧和放着早餐的托盘桌。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80353069"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/44/c1/44c1b3e7d3c6d40e855aa3bcddc6af22.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/44/c1/44c1b3e7d3c6d40e855aa3bcddc6af22.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>虽然无法享受客房送餐服务，给自己</strong>&nbsp;准备一顿舒适的床边早餐也不错。有了托盘桌，即可轻松从厨房把所有饭菜一次性端出来，还不用担心把碎屑和汁液洒在床单上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "阅读区放有扶手椅、落地灯和桌子。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s09033553"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/75/f0/75f090e0f8e14b2b9824d4c856afb9ed.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/75/f0/75f090e0f8e14b2b9824d4c856afb9ed.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>在酒店式卧室&nbsp;消磨一整天时光</strong>&nbsp;，并不意味着必须要呆在床上。带扶手椅和桌子的座位区很有酒店的感觉，在此开辟一方舒适的阅读区，营造别样的室内风景。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "工业风工作灯用作床头灯，后面放上落地灯。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90146791"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cb/64/cb645543a8a04fde36a5f5722e342b23.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cb/64/cb645543a8a04fde36a5f5722e342b23.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>打开这几盏灯。</strong>&nbsp;你是否曾住过只有一盏吸顶灯的酒店房间？住过。有了台灯、落地灯和吸顶灯组合，你就可以控制灯光以满足不同的活动需求。</p>"
   ],
